                      <Font name="Poppins" size="14" style="0"/>
                    </Property>
                    <Property name="text" type="java.lang.String" value="This helps wildlife officials easily monitor elephant movements, track injured animals, and identify damaged fence areas. It brings all important information into one place, allowing officers to review reports, approve alerts, and respond quickly to protect wildlife and nearby communities."/>
